```

## Spawn Run Control

Tracked runs expose `TASK_BOARD_RUN_ID`. Check directives at safe checkpoints,
at most once per 1 minute, never in a loop. Directives have no delivery timer.

```bash
task-board spawn status "$TASK_BOARD_RUN_ID"
task-board spawn directives "$TASK_BOARD_RUN_ID"
```

No inbound push: directives are cooperative checkpoint signals:
- persist your current notes/artifacts before acting on `cancel`-style requests
